decision_conditions:
Condition : 6 - Prior to first occupation, a revised School Travel Plan that includes:
-	Park and stride strategy, including identification of off-street locations, to ensure parking does not inconvenience local residents;
-	Measures to prevent drop-off and pick-up on Twickenham Road and London Road, Park Road, Busch Close and Lodge Road, and monitoring and review thereof;
-	Measures to manage pupils crossing London Road and Twickenham Road, and monitoring and review thereof;
-	Measures to manage parking and access to bus stops, and monitoring and review thereof;
-	Measures to discourage staff from driving, and monitoring thereof; and
-	Welcome packs for parents that include the school's travel policy which they shall agree to comply with,
shall be submitted to approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The Travel Plan shall regularly monitor, review and report to the Council every school term. These measures shall be maintained for the lifetime of the development.
